  "scope": "Every declared complete original legal text matched to read original text, or its complete normalized-word differences read; all remaining GCC runtime exception, Ada/documentation scopes, author list, Google PATENTS, sanitizer and full PSTL grants read. Root project copying context retained. Source-only compiler and independently licensed runtimes/documentation remain separately scoped; no parent SDK/OS clearance.",
